# Admin is not a permission

Do not insert admin-console GraphQL fields into `permissions`. That schema is gated by the caller admin flag, not by permission names.

Journal titles for those fields go to users-actions descriptors only.

```csharp
if (!user.IsAdmin)
    throw new ForbiddenError("Недостаточно прав");
```
